<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;font-weight:400;color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;line-height:1.2;">
  Your security code
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px;color:<%= MailerTheme::BODY_TEXT %>;">
  Use this code to finish signing in to RxTerminal. Do not share it with anyone.
</p>

<div style="margin-bottom:24px;">
  <%= render "shared/mailer/code_card", code: @code, expires_in_minutes: @expires_in_minutes %>
</div>

<%= render "shared/mailer/request_details", request_details: @request_details, requested_at: @requested_at, heading: "Sign-in details" %>

<p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:<%= MailerTheme::BODY_TEXT %>;">
  If this was not you, do not use this code.
  <strong style="color:<%= MailerTheme::HEADING_TEXT %>;">Change your password immediately</strong>
  or ask another admin to disable your account.
</p>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:<%= MailerTheme::LIGHT_MUTED %>;">
  This email was sent because the correct password was entered for an account on RxTerminal.
  RxTerminal will never ask you to share this code.
</p>
